; ReBeep patch. Edit it in ReBeep Studio or by hand.
; OPn= AR DR SL RR OL KSL MULT WAVE TREM VIB SUS KSR, decimal.
; SL and OL: bigger is louder. OCTAVE 4 is the game's pitch.
; The start lights: a racing game's start beep, an octave up. A clean,
; bright tone: instant attack, a short decay, little modulation.
[PATCH]
FORMAT=1
OCTAVE=5

[2OP]
; CONNECTION: FM or AM. FEEDBACK 0..7.
CONNECTION=FM
FEEDBACK=0
OP1=15 3 12 8 38 0 2 0 0 0 1 0
OP2=15 2 13 9 63 0 1 0 0 0 1 0
